# | Advantech ADAM-4055 — 16-Channel Isolated Digital I/O with LED Module
# | 
# | Source: advantech-adam-4000-modbus.pdf (Appendix G, Module 11)
# | - 8 DI + 8 DO isolated digital I/O with LED status indicators.
# | - Modbus RTU, FC01/FC02 for I/O state (coil registers — NOT FC03).
# | - FC01/FC02 00001-00008 (coil addr 0-7): DI Input Signal ch0-7 (R).
# | - FC01 00017-00024 (coil addr 16-23): DO Output Value ch0-7 (R/W).
# | - FC03 40211 (addr 210): Module Name 1 (R).
# | - FC03 40212 (addr 211): Module Name 2 (R).
# | - FC03 40213 (addr 212): Firmware Version 1 (R).
# | - FC03 40214 (addr 213): Firmware Version 2 (R).
# | - FC03 40215 (addr 214): Comm Safety Enable (R).
# | - FC03 40216 (addr 215): Comm Safety Flag (R).
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, 9600 baud, 8N1.
